flowchart TB
  sched[Scheduler] -->|due feed| fetch[Fetcher]
  fetch -->|304: no work| sched
  fetch -->|200: body bytes| raw[Raw store]
  raw -->|same bytes| parse[Parser]
  parse -->|normalized entries| clean[Content cleaner]
  clean -->|block trees| ident[Identity and dedupe]
  ident -->|one batched transaction| store[(SQLite)]
  store -->|events| clients[Clients and aggregator]
